# 统一换行与文本处理，保证跨平台复现的字节一致
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理与 PowerShell 脚本保留 CRLF，避免执行异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制与生成物不做换行转换
*.vvp binary
*.vcd binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# 本轮公开实验原件按字节保存，避免换行转换破坏已登记的 SHA-256。
docs/experiment/agent-comparison-chat-2026-10-04/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
docs/experiment/external-agent-live-2026-10-04/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
docs/experiment/ic-validation-2026-10-04/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
docs/experiment/ic-validation-pdf-final-2026-10-04/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
docs/experiment/ic-pack-smoke-2026-10-04/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
docs/competition/ic/pdf_validation_2026-10-04.json -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
docs/competition/ic/evidence_pack_2026-10-04.json -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol

# 明确语言归属，便于托管平台的统计与语法高亮
